y=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/102.html\">Sura At-Takaathur</a> › Aya 7</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura At-Takaathur 102:7</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ الْيَقِينِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sa&#x27;an nan lalle ne za ku gan ta, da idanu, bayyane.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا أتبع ذلك بالقسم على الرؤية التي هي عين اليقين التي هي فوق الخبر الذي هو علم اليقين<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/518</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فاليقين للسمع وعين اليقين للبصر<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/192</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذه الرؤية الثانية غير الأولى من وجهين إطلاق الأولى وتقييد الثانية بعين اليقين وتقدم الأولى وتراخى الثانية عنها<cite>«عدة الصابرين وذخيرة الشاكرين» 1/188</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s102a7\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/102-6.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (102:6)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/102-8.html\">Aya ta gaba (102:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/102-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin At-Takaathur 102:8 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sa&#x27;an nan lalle ne za a tambaye ku, a rãnar nan lãbãrin ni&#x27;imar (da aka yi muku).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/102-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin At-Takaathur 102:8 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sa&#x27;an nan lalle ne za a tambaye ku, a rãnar nan lãbãrin ni&#x27;imar (da aka yi muku).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura At-Takaathur\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/102.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 8\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/102-8.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/102.html\">Sura At-Takaathur</a> › Aya 8</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura At-Takaathur 102:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿ثُمَّ لَتُسْأَلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعِيمِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sa&#x27;an nan lalle ne za a tambaye ku, a rãnar nan lãbãrin ni&#x27;imar (da aka yi muku).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي عن شكر النعيم فيطالب العبد بأداء شكر نعمة الله على النعيم<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/137</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن الله سبحانه لا يعاقب على ما أباح وإنما يعاقب على ترك مأمور وفعل محذور.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/137</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><h3>Abin da ya ruwaito daga wasu</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">من قال من السلف</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «عن الصحة»<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 4/197</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s102a8\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/102-7.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (102:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/102.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Sura At-Takaathur — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsirin Sura At-Takaathur — Ma&#x27;anonin Alkur&#x27;ani a cikin maganganun Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/102.html\">